# Hotel booking
{Room availability}
Guest: Book room -> (Booking) -> RoomBooked
  * A room is never double-booked for a night
  * A stay lasts at least one night
  then Take deposit -> [Payment provider] -> DepositTaken
  then Send booking confirmation -> [Email service] -> BookingConfirmationSent

Guest: Check in -> (Booking) -> GuestCheckedIn
  then Issue key card -> [Door lock system] -> KeyCardIssued

{Guest folio}
Receptionist: Check out guest -> (Booking) -> GuestCheckedOut
  then Charge remaining balance -> [Payment provider] -> BalanceCharged
    ! What if the card on file has expired?
  then Mark room dirty -> (Room) -> RoomMarkedDirty

{Rooms to clean}
Housekeeper: Clean room -> (Room) -> RoomCleaned
  then Release room for sale -> (Room) -> RoomReleased
    * Only clean rooms go on sale
